sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant App
  participant AW as Appwrite Auth
  participant API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  U->>App: Enter phone
  App->>AW: createPhoneToken
  AW-->>U: SMS code
  U->>App: Enter code
  App->>AW: createSession
  App->>AW: createJWT (15 minutes)
  App->>API: GET /api/v1/me, Bearer JWT
  API->>AW: account.get() with JWT
  AW-->>API: Appwrite user
  API->>DB: Find or create users row, load profiles
  API->>API: Reject if suspended or deleted
  API-->>App: User and roles
